# spec_id: eravos.domains.map · the map of everything ERAVOS can hold (generated by build/domain-specs.mjs)
shell: blank, domain-free (Start · Add · Options). A domain = a folder + packs. Tools = separate folders. Wires = typed ports.
port types (the only way domains meet):
    - audio — Web Audio node (music engine) — sound
    - modulation — control signal (-1…1 or 0…1) into a parameter
    - event — bus topic with a JSON schema (note:trigger, transport:tick, …)
    - asset — a file the kernel holds by hash (audio, image, video, json)
    - image — an image frame (ImageBitmap / OffscreenCanvas), sRGB, with alpha
    - mask — a single-channel image 0…1 (what is selected)
    - video — a timed stream of image frames + its audio (WebCodecs)
    - text — a UTF-8 string
    - json — a JSON value with a schema
    - style — design tokens (colours, type, spacing, radii) as JSON
    - layout — a box tree (component nodes with layout rules)
    - trigger — a pulse with a payload — "go now"
    - number — a single value
